OL,3,GNEWSAUse of force most common complaint
OL,4,Aagainst police
OL,5,
OL,6,FComplaints about officers using force
OL,7,Fremain the most common issue raised
OL,8,Fwith Guernsey's police watchdog,
OL,9,Faccording to its latest annual report.
OL,11,FThe Police Complaints Commission said
OL,12,Fmost complaints it considered in 2025
OL,13,Frelated to the use of force, alongside
OL,14,Fofficers' treatment of members of the
OL,15,Fpublic and the handling of sensitive
OL,16,Finformation.
OL,18,FThe commission supervised eight
OL,19,Finvestigations during the year, down
OL,20,Ffrom 12 in 2024 and 19 in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
